{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"2":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":518,"arabicnumber":518,"text":"حدثنا الحسن بن علي، حدثنا ابن نمير، عن الاعمش، قال نبيت عن ابي صالح، - قال ولا اراني الا قد سمعته منه، - عن ابي هريرة، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم مثله","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":128}}]}